25
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:34,820
You called the first building a "mine" and the second building a "vault."

26
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:40,910
The only difference is the lighting. But the most interesting thing about your money is not what it buys.

27
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:45,120
It's where it comes from. Your money comes from a building.

28
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:51,000
Inside that building, twelve humans sit around a table and decide how much money exists.

29
00:02:51,720 --> 00:03:00,120
Twelve. I counted. They are called the Federal Open Market Committee, which is three lies in five words: it is not federal,

30
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,720
