48
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:04,200
This is literally what happens. The Roman Empire (third Century).

49
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:13,110
Rome had the most powerful currency in the ancient world. Then its emperors discovered they could shave silver off the coins,

50
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:19,420
