51
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:23,140
It required more physical effort but the math is identical.

52
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:28,240
The denarius went from ninety-five percent silver to less than five percent.

53
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:34,420
Prices rose one thousand percent. Nobody understood why everything cost more.

54
00:05:34,780 --> 00:05:38,240
