01:06:31,200 --> 01:06:35,260
Blaming Friedman for corporate greed is like blaming a weather report for rain.

592
01:06:35,760 --> 01:06:42,200
It has been raining for four hundred years. Your economists are pointing at the television and saying, "That's where the

593
01:06:42,200 --> 01:06:46,700
