594
01:06:47,380 --> 01:06:53,220
Greed was not invented in nineteen seventy-one. Humans have been greedy since before they were humans.

595
01:06:53,680 --> 01:07:00,080
Your ancestors were greedy when they were still in trees. (They were greedy *about* the trees.) The question is not whether

596
01:07:00,080 --> 01:07:04,040
