597
01:07:04,800 --> 01:07:11,160
Before nineteen seventy-one, there was exactly one way to get rich: make something people wanted more than their money.

598
01:07:11,620 --> 01:07:18,500
You had to build a factory, hire workers, pay them enough to show up, and produce goods or services that a human would voluntarily

599
